          "normalized_message": "Services with both build and image keys escape all enforcement | check_compose_text requires a retention label only when a service has build and no image key, and the elif branch for image-bearing services only forbids the label. A service with both build: and image: (a common compose pattern to tag built images) skips the label requirement entirely. Worse, docker compose down --rmi local deliberately does not remove images that carry a custom tag from an image: key, so such an image evades both the label-d",
