          "normalized_message": "Annotation escape hatch is over-broad | A single 'compose-image-retention-ok:' comment within 12 lines suppresses every check that scans that region: the teardown requirement for any -f ref in the step, and the global --rmi all ban. Because ANNOTATION_WINDOW is bidirectional and substring-based on the ref, one annotation near a shared line disables enforcement for all refs and all flags in the vicinity, including the explicitly forbidden --rmi all. An exception mechanism that can legitimize the harshest var",
