          "normalized_message": "List-form build.labels silently misclassified | Compose permits labels as a list of key=value strings. check_compose_text coerces a non-dict build.labels to {}, then reports the service as unlabeled. A compliant service using list form produces a false positive, which trains developers to add annotations, eroding the gate. The pulled-service branch handles list form; the built-service branch does not. | Evidence: if not isinstance(labels, dict): labels = {} | Fix: Normalize list-form labels to a dict (split",
