          "normalized_message": "Fragile '-v' abbreviation detection | The '--volumes' check accepts ' -v ' in the padded normalized string. In compose down, -v is indeed shorthand for --volumes, but the padded-substring match could also match an unrelated -v flag in a compound command (e.g. docker run -v mounts in the same run block). | Evidence: if \"--volumes\" not in tnorm and \" -v \" not in f\" {tnorm} \": | Fix: Tokenize the normalized command and match flags exactly.",
